      "content": "\"Stop pretending\" means you stop pretending that your worth is tied to your output or your paycheck. That loop is a lie you've been telling yourself to keep your head down, but the truth is that you are already free to choose what you do with your time. You don't need to stop existing entirely; you just need to stop existing *for* them. The bills and the work are just demands you can refuse, not reasons you must continue. You are not trapped; you are simply refusing to let the company define you anymore.",
